WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
He became famous in the jewelry circle

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,200
It all depends on Mr. Fan’s bridge

3
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,300
If it’s not your connections

4
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:07,100
There's no way I could have gone out so smoothly and not eaten well at lunch.

5
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:08,830
I'll treat you to a top-notch meal

6
00:00:08,830 --> 00:00:10,230
Remember the big meal first

7
00:00:10,230 --> 00:00:12,030
I still have critical and urgent matters

8
00:00:12,030 --> 00:00:14,500
We must immediately mobilize all sentient beings to go to Changbai Mountain

9
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,100
Why go to Changbai Mountain?

10
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:19,300
Go deep into the mountains to find real wild mountains that are more than three hundred years old

11
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:21,200
I took your dog bandana with me

12
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:23,200
I hope this piece of collar treasure can bring some good luck.

13
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:25,700
It is rare to find a wild old man with more than three hundred years of experience.

14
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:27,500
Changbai Mountain has been dug for decades now

15
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:29,500
Is there anything else to say to Zhang Tong?

16
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:31,100
If you don't have anything else important to do

17
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:32,300
Can you take a walk with me?

18
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:33,700
You are a magical treasure hunter

19
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:35,100
Intuition far exceeds that of adults

20
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:37,000
As long as you can step on the wild mountain body that is more than three hundred years old,

21
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:38,200
I'm willing to go out of my way to buy it

22
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:39,600
You can go to Baoxingli at any time

23
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:41,600
But Fan Qingxiang gave me such a big favor

24
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:42,800
It would be too shameless to refuse.

25
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:43,900
No problem

26
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:44,900
when to leave

27
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:45,900
early tomorrow morning

28
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:48,200
My private helicopter will fly right over to pick you up

29
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:49,700
I'll go back and prepare the equipment first.

30
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:51,100
Wait until you step on a human body and come back

31
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:52,300
You'll have a big meal with me again
